摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Portable Agent Skill for developing and auditing DeepSeek Harness plugins, with an optional profile-installable DSH bundle adapter.","id":"gh:1334014671","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plugin-development","slug":"w2112515/dsh-plugin-development","topics":["agent-skills","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","plugin-development"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Portable Agent Skill for developing and auditing DeepSeek Harness plugins, with an optional profile-"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"installable DSH bundle adapter."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Plugin Development"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"DSH Plugin Development is a portable Agent Skill for designing, implementing, packaging, reviewing, "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"and diagnosing DeepSeek Harness plugins. The same canonical Skill directory works with Codex, Claude"},{"id":"p3s3","text":" Code, and DSH. An optional DSH bundle adapter adds profile-scoped installation and reversible remov"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"al without creating another copy of the workflow."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> Beta and unofficial. This community project is not affiliated with or endorsed by DeepSeek. DeepSe"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ek Harness is in developer preview, so current repository instructions, executable constraints, type"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"s, manifests, and Loader behavior remain authoritative."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Project shape"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Part | Purpose |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| `skills/dsh-plugin-development` | Canonical portable Skill and its on-demand references and script"},{"id":"p7s2","text":". |\n| `skills/dsh-plugin-development/agents/openai.yaml` | Optional Codex UI metadata; it does not f"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ork the Skill instructions. |\n| `index.js` and `cordis.patch.yml` | Thin optional adapter that regis"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ters the canonical Skill in a DSH profile. |\n| `.codex-plugin` / `.claude-plugin` | Intentionally ab"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"sent. Neither host requires a plugin to use the Skill. |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The Skill distinguishes live dynamic Cordis plugins, source-backed DSH workspace packages, and out-o"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"f-tree installable bundles before applying mode-specific rules. It adds no MCP server, account, cred"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ential, or remote-service dependency."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Codex"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Install or link the canonical directory as either:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- a personal Skill at `~/.codex/skills/dsh-plugin-development`; or\n- a repository Skill at `<repo>/."},{"id":"p11s2","text":"agents/skills/dsh-plugin-development`."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"You can also ask `$skill-installer` to install this GitHub directory:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Invoke it explicitly with `$dsh-plugin-development`, or let its description trigger it for matching "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"DSH plugin work. A Codex plugin is not required."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Claude Code"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Install or link the same canonical directory as either:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- a personal Skill at `~/.claude/skills/dsh-plugin-development`; or\n- a repository Skill at `<repo>/"},{"id":"p17s2","text":".claude/skills/dsh-plugin-development`."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Invoke it with `/dsh-plugin-development`, or let Claude load it automatically for matching work. The"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" directory uses the portable Agent Skills frontmatter subset and does not depend on Claude-only argu"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ments, shell injection, subagent fields, or path variables. A Claude Code plugin is not required."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"DSH can discover the same directory directly from:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- `<repo>/.dsh/skills/dsh-plugin-development`;\n- `<repo>/.agents/skills/dsh-plugin-development`; or\n"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"- `<dshHome>/skills/dsh-plugin-development`."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The repository `.agents/skills` location is shared by Codex and DSH, so those two hosts can consume "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"one checked-in copy."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Optional DSH bundle adapter"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Use the bundle only when you want `dsh plugin` to own profile-scoped installation, versioning, compo"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"sition, and removal:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The command below installs the current `v0.2.0-beta.1` adapter. The previous `v0.1.0-beta.1` release"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"nstalls the current `v0.2.0-beta.1` adapter. The previous `v0.1.0-beta.1` release remains immutable."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The dumped configuration should contain the `dsh-plugin-development` layer and row ID `dsh-plugin-de"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"velopment-skill`. The adapter reads metadata and instructions from the packaged canonical Skill, reg"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"isters it through `ctx.skills`, and disposes that registration when removed."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"For local adapter development:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Git installation also needs no `prepare` or pnpm `allowBuilds` because the package ships plain JavaS"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"so needs no `prepare` or pnpm `allowBuilds` because the package ships plain JavaScript and Markdown:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Use a reviewed commit SHA instead of a movable branch for higher-assurance Git installs."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Portable compatibility contract"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The canonical directory follows the Agent Skills specification:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- `SKILL.md` uses only the shared `name` and `description` frontmatter fields;\n- the directory name "},{"id":"p35s2","text":"matches the Skill name;\n- references and scripts use paths relative to the Skill directory;\n- detail"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"ed mode guidance loads on demand; and\n- host-specific UI metadata does not alter the workflow."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Format compatibility does not make unavailable tools appear. Dynamic runtime work still requires liv"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"e Cordis inspection, definition, and run tools. Without them, the Skill must stop at source-backed d"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"esign or diagnosis and report that activation was not verified."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## What the Skill covers"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"| DSH plugin mode | Typical request | Completion evidence |"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"| Dynamic runtime Cordis plugin | Define process-local Host or Client behavior with live Cordis tool"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"s | Live provider and Slot inspection, define/run state, and final diagnostics |\n| DSH workspace plu"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"gin | Add or modify packages shipped in the DSH repository | Current repository authority, focused t"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"ests, real Loader composition, lifecycle proof, and snapshots when product-visible |\n| Installable D"},{"id":"p39s5","text":"SH bundle | Ship an external package with `dsh.bundle` and `cordis.patch.yml` | Packed files, isolat"},{"id":"p39s6","text":"ed profile installation, `--dump-config`, packaged boot, and cleanup evidence |"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"The workflow also covers Loader export failures, Service Definition/Provider/Consumer ownership, mod"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"el-visible logging, Client Slots, CLI surfaces, configuration, lifecycle disposal, profile precedenc"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"e, Git build risk, and audit-only authorization. Marketplace listing and solution packs (整合包) belong"},{"id":"p40s4","text":" to `dsh-marketplace-publish`."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Precedence and lifecycle"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Direct project Skills remain under the host's normal discovery and precedence rules. In DSH, project"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"-local entries can override the optional runtime registration by name. Removing the bundle disposes "},{"id":"p42s3","text":"only its registration; it does not delete separately installed personal or project Skill directories"},{"id":"p42s4","text":"nly its registration; it does not delete separately installed personal or project Skill directories."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"### How should a compatibility problem be reported?"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Open an issue with the host and version, DSH version or commit, selected plugin mode, target entry p"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"ath, exact request or command, observed result, and unavailable evidence. Do not include credentials"},{"id":"p44s3","text":" or private runtime data."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

